---
import SectionTitle from "../common/SectionTitle.astro"
---

<section
  id="aboutme"
  class="mb-16 scroll-mt-16 md:mb-24 lg:mb-36 lg:scroll-mt-24"
  aria-label="About me"
>
  <SectionTitle en="About me" es="Sobre mí" />

  <div class="grid gap-10 md:grid-cols-[1fr_280px] md:items-start">
    <!-- Content -->
    <div class="space-y-6">
      <div
        class="space-y-4 text-base leading-7 text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-400"
      >
        <p data-lang="es">
          Soy Ingeniero en Sistemas especializado en Data Engineering, ETL y
          SQL, con experiencia desarrollando soluciones para integración,
          transformación y automatización de datos.
        </p>

        <p data-lang="en">
          I am a Systems Engineer specialized in Data Engineering, ETL, and SQL,
          with experience developing solutions for data integration,
          transformation, and automation.
        </p>

        <p data-lang="es">
          Actualmente trabajo con Oracle Data Integrator, SQL Server y SAP
          BusinessObjects, desarrollando procesos ETL, procedimientos
          almacenados y reportes orientados a las necesidades del negocio.
        </p>

        <p data-lang="en">
          I currently work with Oracle Data Integrator, SQL Server, and SAP
          BusinessObjects, developing ETL processes, stored procedures, and
          reports focused on business needs.
        </p>

        <p data-lang="es">
          Mi experiencia también incluye desarrollo de software y QA Automation,
          utilizando tecnologías como JavaScript, TypeScript, Python, React,
          Node.js, Playwright y Postman. Esta combinación me permite entender
          las soluciones desde la construcción de datos y software hasta su
          validación y calidad.
        </p>

        <p data-lang="en">
          My experience also includes software development and QA Automation,
          using technologies such as JavaScript, TypeScript, Python, React,
          Node.js, Playwright, and Postman. This combination allows me to
          understand solutions from data and software development through
          validation and quality assurance.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Focus areas -->
      <div class="grid gap-3 pt-2 sm:grid-cols-3">
        <div
          class="rounded-lg border border-neutral-200 bg-neutral-50/60 p-4 dark:border-neutral-800 dark:bg-neutral-900/40"
        >
          <h3
            class="text-sm font-medium text-neutral-900 dark:text-neutral-100"
          >
            Data Engineering
          </h3>
          <p
            class="mt-1 text-xs leading-5 text-neutral-500 dark:text-neutral-400"
          >
            ETL · ODI · SQL · Data Integration
          </p>
        </div>

        <div
          class="rounded-lg border border-neutral-200 bg-neutral-50/60 p-4 dark:border-neutral-800 dark:bg-neutral-900/40"
        >
          <h3
            class="text-sm font-medium text-neutral-900 dark:text-neutral-100"
          >
            Software
          </h3>
          <p
            class="mt-1 text-xs leading-5 text-neutral-500 dark:text-neutral-400"
          >
            React · Node.js · Python · TypeScript
          </p>
        </div>

        <div
          class="rounded-lg border border-neutral-200 bg-neutral-50/60 p-4 dark:border-neutral-800 dark:bg-neutral-900/40"
        >
          <h3
            class="text-sm font-medium text-neutral-900 dark:text-neutral-100"
          >
            Quality
          </h3>
          <p
            class="mt-1 text-xs leading-5 text-neutral-500 dark:text-neutral-400"
          >
            Playwright · API Testing · Automation
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="border-t border-neutral-200 pt-5 dark:border-neutral-800">
        <p
          data-lang="es"
          class="text-sm leading-6 text-neutral-500 dark:text-neutral-400"
        >
          Fuera del trabajo, disfruto el ajedrez, la programación, aprender
          idiomas, caminar y los videojuegos.
        </p>

        <p
          data-lang="en"
          class="text-sm leading-6 text-neutral-500 dark:text-neutral-400"
        >
          Outside of work, I enjoy chess, programming, learning languages,
          walking, and video games.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Image -->
    <div class="hidden md:sticky md:top-24 md:block">
      <div
        class="aspect-square overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-neutral-200 bg-neutral-50 dark:border-neutral-800 dark:bg-neutral-900"
      >
        <img
          src="/about.jpg"
          alt="Francisco Mejía"
          class="h-full w-full object-cover"
          loading="lazy"
        />
      </div>

      <p class="mt-3 text-center text-xs text-neutral-400">
        <span data-lang="es">Ingeniería · Datos · Software</span>
        <span data-lang="en">Engineering · Data · Software</span>
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
